  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As he grows in strength, the ungermaw’s already impressive bite becomes stronger. At 5th level, the ungermaw gets a +1 bonus on attack and damage rolls made using his bite attack. This bonus increases by +1 and an additional +1 every 4 levels, to a maximum of +4 at 17th level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ungermaw#toc33\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
